  "question": {
    "text": "The number of rational point(s) (a point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is rational, if <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi></math> both are rational numbers) on the circumference of a circle having centre <math> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mi>π</mi><mtext>,</mtext>&nbsp;&nbsp;<mtext>e</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;is",
